[info] >    "translation": "Every morning I wake up at seven. I have breakfast with one slice of bread, just one, and drink little milk: not much, because I am not hungry. Before leaving, I make one sandwich for lunch, just one. At work I have little time to eat: only fifteen minutes. In the afternoon I drink two glasses of water: one at three and one at five. In the evening I go for a thirty-minute walk, that is, half an hour." {"user":"  \"translation\": \"Every morning I wake up at seven. I have breakfast with one slice of bread, just one, and drink little milk: not much, because I am not hungry. Before leaving, I make one sandwich for lunch, just one. At work I have little time to eat: only fifteen minutes. In the afternoon I drink two glasses of water: one at three and one at five. In the evening I go for a thirty-minute walk, that is, half an hour.\"","metadata":{"emulator":{"name":"functions"},"function":{"name":"us-central1-generateExercise"},"extension":{},"message":"\u001b[90m> \u001b[39m   \"translation\": \"Every morning I wake up at seven. I have breakfast with one slice of bread, just one, and drink little milk: not much, because I am not hungry. Before leaving, I make one sandwich for lunch, just one. At work I have little time to eat: only fifteen minutes. In the afternoon I drink two glasses of water: one at three and one at five. In the evening I go for a thirty-minute walk, that is, half an hour.\""}}
